    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that high-resolution climate models provide more realistic simulations of sub-daily summer precipitation extremes and can project larger, scale-dependent climate change signals for these events compared to their coarse-scale drivers, questioning the validity of common downscaling assumptions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
